# Files that must never reach a release archive.
#
# `git archive` honours `export-ignore`, so the paths below are left out of
# the source ZIP that a Netlify hosted build consumes. The verification
# evidence and the demo screenshots are large, are not part of the
# application, and are already published through the repository's own
# history.
#
# This affects archives only. The files stay in the repository and stay
# visible to `git show`, so the evidence remains reviewable.
averianlabs-web/docs/verification/** export-ignore
averianlabs-web/docs/demo-screenshots-2026-10-20/** export-ignore
averianlabs-web/reports/** export-ignore
